# Throngs settings. ./install.sh copies this to .env; the welcome tour's setup checklist (and `node bin/sm.js doctor`)
# shows what's still missing. Everything here is optional: the office runs without any of it.
#
# Accounts (Google, Telegram, Twilio, Slack, ...) are NOT set here: link them in the office's Zoo. Their keys stay on
# this machine in office/integrations.json (git-ignored).

# Crew voices, video narration and IVY's phone voice (elevenlabs.io → Profile → API keys)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# optional: any voice id from your ElevenLabs library, and model
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM
# ELEVENLABS_MODEL_ID=eleven_turbo_v2_5
